  "construction_notes": [
    {
      "text": "City lists APNs 093-312-050 and -060, not in the county layer; 093-312-080, -090 and -100 are 1051 Mission Road by situs. City map states no unit count.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001342"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "San Mateo County AHF predevelopment pipeline, September 2024: 1051 Mission (Bridge Housing): 156 total units, 21% at 15-30% AMI and 79% at 31-60% AMI. The affordable component of this site, recorded as a note.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001649"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Resolution 176-2020: L37/KASA partnered with Bridge Housing Corporation to build and operate the 158 below-market-rate units in a stand-alone affordable building at the northernmost part of the site. Bridge requested the $2 million loan as the City's matching contribution.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-002105"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "City funding page lists Bridge Housing's loan request for 1051 Mission Road at $17,555,194, with $2,000,000 awarded plus a to-be-determined amount from the Local Housing Trust Fund.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-002106"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "City financing plan FY2025-2027 allocates Local Housing Trust Fund money to 1051 Mission Road.",
